governing_equations.source_expression:
                                       {𝑡}                         {𝑡− 𝑗 }
                                  𝑝ˆ         = 𝑝0 +         𝛾𝑗 𝑝             +         𝜃 𝑗 𝜀 {𝑡− 𝑗 }
                                                      𝑗=1                        𝑗=1

where 𝑝 is the order of Autoregressive Model (AR),𝑞 is the order of Moving Average Model (AM),𝜀 {𝑡}
is the Error term between time 𝑡 and 𝑡 − 1, 𝛾 𝑗 and 𝜃 𝑗 are the fitting coefficients, 𝑝 0 is constant term.
